pgxbackup (2.59.0-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of pgxbackup, the continuity fork of pgBackRest 2.58.
    Surface rename only: binary, default paths, and project name change to
    pgxbackup. On-disk format identifiers are preserved so existing backup
    repositories produced by upstream pgBackRest are fully readable, and
    /etc/pgbackrest.conf is probed for backward compatibility.
  * Coexists with the pgbackrest package; no Conflicts/Replaces.

 -- pgxbackup maintainers <pgxbackup@pgexperts.com>  Thu, 30 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
